# Blazor specific
# These were previously written without the `**/` prefix, and a pattern containing an internal
# slash is anchored to the directory holding this file. The client's wwwroot is at
# src/PoSeeReview.Client/wwwroot/, so none of these four ever matched anything — verified with
# `git check-ignore`. `wwwroot/lib/` is deliberately not re-added: the app vendors no libraries
# (the graphics layer is hand-rolled, and MapLibre is a CDN dynamic import), so a new `lib/`
# directory is something we want to see in review rather than something to hide.
**/wwwroot/_framework/
**/wwwroot/css/*.min.css
**/wwwroot/js/*.min.js

